252		Define the linear map
253		\[
254			V_{\mathrm{A}} = \sum_{g_X,g_Z} (\hat{S}_{g_X,g_Z})_{\mathrm{A}\mathrm{A}'} \ot \bigl(\tau^X(\mathrm{Dec}(g_Z)) \, \tau^Z(\mathrm{Dec}(g_X))\bigr)_{\mathrm{A}''}\;,
255		\]
256		where $\tau^X(\cdot)$ and $\tau^Z(\cdot)$ are the generalized Pauli observables acting on $(\C^q)^{\ot M}$; note that the argument of $\tau^X$ is $\mathrm{Dec}(g_Z)$ and the argument of $\tau^Z$ is $\mathrm{Dec}(g_X)$. The map $V_{\mathrm{B}}$, acting on registers $\mathrm{B}\mathrm{B}'\mathrm{B}''$, is defined analogously.
